#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`!urllib.request` --- Extensible library for opening URLs"
msgstr ":mod:`!urllib.request` --- 用來開啟 URLs 的可擴充函式庫"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:7
msgid "**Source code:** :source:`Lib/urllib/request.py`"
msgstr "**原始碼：**\\ :source:`Lib/urllib/request.py`"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:11
msgid ""
"The :mod:`!urllib.request` module defines functions and classes which help "
"in opening URLs (mostly HTTP) in a complex world --- basic and digest "
"authentication, redirections, cookies and more."
msgstr ""
":mod:`!urllib.request` module（模組）定義了一些函式與 class（類別）用以開啟 "
"URLs（大部分是 HTTP），並處理各式複雜情況如：basic 驗證與 digest 驗證、重新導"
"向、cookies。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:17
msgid ""
"The `Requests package <https://requests.readthedocs.io/en/master/>`_ is "
"recommended for a higher-level HTTP client interface."
msgstr ""
"有關於更高階的 HTTP 用戶端介面，推薦使用 `Requests 套件 <https://"
"requests.readthedocs.io/en/master/>`_。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:22
msgid ""
"On macOS it is unsafe to use this module in programs using :func:`os.fork` "
"because the :func:`getproxies` implementation for macOS uses a higher-level "
"system API. Set the environment variable ``no_proxy`` to ``*`` to avoid this "
"problem (e.g. ``os.environ[\"no_proxy\"] = \"*\"``)."
msgstr ""
"在 macOS 上，於使用 :func:`os.fork` 的程式中使用此模組並不安全，因為 macOS "
"的 :func:`getproxies` 實作使用了較高階的系統 API。將環境變數 ``no_proxy`` 設"
"為 ``*`` 即可避免此問題（例如 ``os.environ[\"no_proxy\"] = \"*\"``）。"

#: ../../includes/wasm-notavail.rst:3
msgid "Availability"
msgstr "可用性"

#: ../../includes/wasm-notavail.rst:5
msgid ""
"This module does not work or is not available on WebAssembly. See :ref:`wasm-"
"availability` for more information."
msgstr ""
"此模組在 WebAssembly 平台上不起作用或無法使用。更多資訊請參閱 :ref:`wasm-"
"availability`。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:30
msgid "The :mod:`!urllib.request` module defines the following functions:"
msgstr ":mod:`!urllib.request` module 定義下列函式："

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:35
msgid ""
"Open *url*, which can be either a string containing a valid, properly "
"encoded URL, or a :class:`Request` object."
msgstr ""
"打開 *url*，其值可以是一個包含有效且適當編碼 URL 的字串或是一"
"個 :class:`Request` 物件。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:38
msgid ""
"*data* must be an object specifying additional data to be sent to the "
"server, or ``None`` if no such data is needed.  See :class:`Request` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"*data* 必須是一個包含傳送給伺服器額外資料的物件，若不需要傳送額外資料則指定"
"為 ``None``。更多細節請見 :class:`Request`。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:42
msgid ""
"urllib.request module uses HTTP/1.1 and includes ``Connection:close`` header "
"in its HTTP requests."
msgstr ""
"urllib.request module 使用 HTTP/1.1 並包含 ``Connection:close`` 標頭 "
"(header) 在其 HTTP 請求中。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:45
msgid ""
"The optional *timeout* parameter specifies a timeout in seconds for blocking "
"operations like the connection attempt (if not specified, the global default "
"timeout setting will be used).  This actually only works for HTTP, HTTPS and "
"FTP connections."
msgstr ""
"透過選擇性參數 *timeout* 來指定 blocking operations（阻塞性操作，如：嘗試連"
"接）的 timeout（超時時間），以秒為單位。若沒有指定值，則會使用全域預設超時時"
"間設定。實際上，此參數僅作用於 HTTP、HTTPS 以及 FTP 的連接。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:50
msgid ""
"If *context* is specified, it must be a :class:`ssl.SSLContext` instance "
"describing the various SSL options. "
"See :class:`~http.client.HTTPSConnection` for more details."
msgstr ""
"若 *context* 有被指定時，它必須是一個 :class:`ssl.SSLContext` 的實例並描述著"
"各種 SSL 選項。更多細節請見 :class:`~http.client.HTTPSConnection`。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:54
msgid ""
"This function always returns an object which can work as a :term:`context "
"manager` and has the properties *url*, *headers*, and *status*. "
"See :class:`urllib.response.addinfourl` for more detail on these properties."
msgstr ""
"這個函式總是回傳一個可作為 :term:`context manager` 使用的物件，並有著特性 "
"(property) *url*、*headers* 與 *status*。欲知更多這些特性細節請參"
"見 :class:`urllib.response.addinfourl`。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:58
msgid ""
"For HTTP and HTTPS URLs, this function returns "
"a :class:`http.client.HTTPResponse` object slightly modified. In addition to "
"the three new methods above, the msg attribute contains the same information "
"as the :attr:`~http.client.HTTPResponse.reason` attribute --- the reason "
"phrase returned by server --- instead of the response headers as it is "
"specified in the documentation for :class:`~http.client.HTTPResponse`."
msgstr ""
"對於 HTTP 與 HTTPS 的 URLs，這個函式回傳一個稍有不同"
"的 :class:`http.client.HTTPResponse` 物件。除了上述提到的三個方法外，另有 "
"msg 屬性並有著與 :attr:`~http.client.HTTPResponse.reason` 相同的資訊 --- 由伺"
"服器回傳的原因敘述 (reason phrase)，而不是"
"在 :class:`~http.client.HTTPResponse` 文件中提到的回應標頭。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:66
msgid ""
"For FTP, file, and data URLs, this function returns "
"a :class:`urllib.response.addinfourl` object."
msgstr ""
"對於 FTP、檔案及資料的 URLs，這個函式會回傳一"
"個 :class:`urllib.response.addinfourl` 物件。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:69
msgid "Raises :exc:`~urllib.error.URLError` on protocol errors."
msgstr "當遇到協定上的錯誤時會引發 :exc:`~urllib.error.URLError`。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:71
msgid ""
"Exceptions raised while reading or parsing an HTTP response are not wrapped "
"in :exc:`~urllib.error.URLError` and propagate unchanged. These include "
"subclasses of :exc:`http.client.HTTPException`, such "
"as :exc:`~http.client.BadStatusLine` for a malformed status line, and "
"subclasses of :exc:`OSError`, such as :exc:`TimeoutError` if the server does "
"not respond within *timeout* seconds, "
"or :exc:`~http.client.RemoteDisconnected` if the server closes the "
"connection without sending a response.  :exc:`ValueError` is raised if *url* "
"is not a valid URL."
msgstr ""
"讀取或剖析 HTTP 回應時引發的例外不會被包裝成 :exc:`~urllib.error.URLError`，"
"而是原樣向上傳播。這些例外包括 :exc:`http.client.HTTPException` 的子類別，例"
"如狀態列格式錯誤時的 :exc:`~http.client.BadStatusLine`；以及 :exc:`OSError` "
"的子類別，例如伺服器未在 *timeout* 秒內回應時的 :exc:`TimeoutError`，或伺服器"
"未送出回應就關閉連線時的 :exc:`~http.client.RemoteDisconnected`。若 *url* 不"
"是有效的 URL，則會引發 :exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:81
msgid ""
"Note that ``None`` may be returned if no handler handles the request (though "
"the default installed global :class:`OpenerDirector` "
"uses :class:`UnknownHandler` to ensure this never happens)."
msgstr ""
"請注意若沒有處理器 (handler) 處理請求時，``None`` 值將會被回傳。（即使有預設"
"的全域類別 :class:`OpenerDirector` 使用 :class:`UnknownHandler` 來確保這種情"
"況不會發生）"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:85
msgid ""
"In addition, if proxy settings are detected (for example, when a ``*_proxy`` "
"environment variable like :envvar:`!http_proxy` is "
"set), :class:`ProxyHandler` is default installed and makes sure the requests "
"are handled through the proxy."
msgstr ""
"另外，若有偵測到代理伺服器的設定（例如當 ``*_proxy`` 環境變數像是：:envvar:`!"
"http_proxy` 有被設定時），:class:`ProxyHandler` 會被預設使用以確保請求有透過"
"代理伺服器來處理。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:90
msgid ""
"The legacy ``urllib.urlopen`` function from Python 2.6 and earlier has been "
"discontinued; :func:`urllib.request.urlopen` corresponds to the old "
"``urllib2.urlopen``.  Proxy handling, which was done by passing a dictionary "
"parameter to ``urllib.urlopen``, can be obtained by "
"using :class:`ProxyHandler` objects."
msgstr ""
"Python 2.6 或更早版本的遺留函式 ``urllib.urlopen`` 已經不再被維護；新函"
"式 :func:`urllib.request.urlopen` 對應到舊函式 ``urllib2.urlopen``。有關代理"
"伺服器的處理，以往是透過傳遞 dictionary（字典）參數給 ``urllib.urlopen`` 來取"
"得的，現在則可以透過 :class:`ProxyHandler` 物件來取得。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:96 ../../library/urllib.request.rst:98
msgid ""
"The default opener raises an :ref:`auditing event <auditing>` "
"``urllib.Request`` with arguments ``fullurl``, ``data``, ``headers``, "
"``method`` taken from the request object."
msgstr ""
"預設的 opener 會觸發一個 :ref:`auditing event <auditing>` ``urllib.Request`` "
"與其從請求物件中所獲得的引數 ``fullurl``、``data``、``headers``、``method``。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:102
msgid "*cafile* and *capath* were added."
msgstr "新增 *cafile* 與 *capath*。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:105
msgid ""
"HTTPS virtual hosts are now supported if possible (that is, "
"if :const:`ssl.HAS_SNI` is true)."
msgstr ""
"HTTPS 虛擬主機 (virtual hosts) 現已支援，只要 :const:`ssl.HAS_SNI` 的值為 "
"true。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:108
msgid "*data* can be an iterable object."
msgstr "*data* 可以是一個可疊代物件。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:110
msgid "*cadefault* was added."
msgstr "*cadefault* 被新增。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:113
msgid "*context* was added."
msgstr "*context* 被新增。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:116
msgid ""
"HTTPS connection now send an ALPN extension with protocol indicator ``http/"
"1.1`` when no *context* is given. Custom *context* should set ALPN protocols "
"with :meth:`~ssl.SSLContext.set_alpn_protocols`."
msgstr ""
"當 *context* 沒有被指定時，HTTPS 連線現在會傳送一個帶有協定指示器 ``http/"
"1.1`` 的 ALPN 擴充 (extension)。自訂的 *context* 應該利"
"用 :meth:`~ssl.SSLContext.set_alpn_protocols` 來自行設定 ALPN 協定。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:121
msgid ""
"Remove *cafile*, *capath* and *cadefault* parameters: use the *context* "
"parameter instead."
msgstr "移除 *cafile*、*capath* 與 *cadefault* 參數：請改用 *context* 參數。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:128
msgid ""
"Install an :class:`OpenerDirector` instance as the default global opener. "
"Installing an opener is only necessary if you want urlopen to use that "
"opener; otherwise, simply call :meth:`OpenerDirector.open` instead "
"of :func:`~urllib.request.urlopen`.  The code does not check for a "
"real :class:`OpenerDirector`, and any class with the appropriate interface "
"will work."
msgstr ""
"安裝一個 :class:`OpenerDirector` 實例作為預設的全域 opener。僅在當你想要讓 "
"urlopen 使用該 opener 時安裝一個 opener，否則的話應直接呼"
"叫 :meth:`OpenerDirector.open` 而非 :func:`~urllib.request.urlopen`。程式碼不"
"會檢查 class 是否真的為 :class:`OpenerDirector`，而是任何具有正確介面的 "
"class 都能適用。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:138
msgid ""
"Return an :class:`OpenerDirector` instance, which chains the handlers in the "
"order given. *handler*\\s can be either instances of :class:`BaseHandler`, "
"or subclasses of :class:`BaseHandler` (in which case it must be possible to "
"call the constructor without any parameters).  Instances of the following "
"classes will be in front of the *handler*\\s, unless the *handler*\\s "
"contain them, instances of them or subclasses of them: :class:`ProxyHandler` "
"(if proxy settings are "
"detected), :class:`UnknownHandler`, :class:`HTTPHandler`, :class:`HTTPDefaultErrorHandler`, :class:`HTTPRedirectHandler`, :class:`FTPHandler`, :class:`FileHandler`, :class:`HTTPErrorProcessor`."
msgstr ""
"回傳一個 :class:`OpenerDirector` 實例，以給定的順序把處理器串接起來。"
"*handler*\\s 可以是 :class:`BaseHandler` 的實例，亦或是 :class:`BaseHandler` "
"的 subclasses（這個情況下必須有不帶參數的建構函式能夠被呼叫）。以下 classes "
"的實例順位會在 *handler*\\s 之前，除非 *handler*\\s 已經包含它們，是它們的實"
"例，或是它們的 subclasses：:class:`ProxyHandler`\\ （如果代理伺服器設定被偵測"
"到）、:class:`UnknownHandler`、:class:`HTTPHandler`、:class:`HTTPDefaultErrorHandler`、:class:`HTTPRedirectHandler`、:class:`FTPHandler`、:class:`FileHandler`、:class:`HTTPErrorProcessor`。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:148
msgid ""
"If the Python installation has SSL support (i.e., if the :mod:`ssl` module "
"can be imported), :class:`HTTPSHandler` will also be added."
msgstr ""
"如果 Python 安裝時已帶有 SSL 支援（如果 :mod:`ssl` module 能夠被 import），"
"則 :class:`HTTPSHandler` 也在上述 class 之中。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:151
msgid ""
"A :class:`BaseHandler` subclass may also change its :attr:`handler_order` "
"attribute to modify its position in the handlers list."
msgstr ""
"一個 :class:`BaseHandler` 的 subclass 可能透過改變其 :attr:`handler_order` 屬"
"性來調整它在處理器串列中的位置。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:157
msgid ""
"Convert the given local path to a ``file:`` URL. This function "
"uses :func:`~urllib.parse.quote` function to encode the path."
msgstr ""
"將給定的本機路徑轉換為 ``file:`` URL。此函式使用 :func:`~urllib.parse.quote` "
"函式來編碼路徑。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:160
msgid ""
"If *add_scheme* is false (the default), the return value omits the ``file:`` "
"scheme prefix. Set *add_scheme* to true to return a complete URL."
msgstr ""
"若 *add_scheme* 為 false（預設值），回傳值會省略 ``file:`` scheme 前綴。將 "
"*add_scheme* 設為 true 即可回傳完整的 URL。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:163 ../../library/urllib.request.rst:201
msgid "This example shows the function being used on Windows::"
msgstr "以下範例展示此函式在 Windows 上的用法： ::"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:165
msgid ""
">>> from urllib.request import pathname2url\n"
">>> path = 'C:\\\\Program Files'\n"
">>> pathname2url(path, add_scheme=True)\n"
"'file:///C:/Program%20Files'"
msgstr ""
">>> from urllib.request import pathname2url\n"
">>> path = 'C:\\\\Program Files'\n"
">>> pathname2url(path, add_scheme=True)\n"
"'file:///C:/Program%20Files'"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:170 ../../library/urllib.request.rst:208
msgid ""
"Windows drive letters are no longer converted to uppercase, and ``:`` "
"characters not following a drive letter no longer cause an :exc:`OSError` "
"exception to be raised on Windows."
msgstr ""
"Windows 磁碟機代號不再被轉換為大寫，且不在磁碟機代號之後的 ``:`` 字元不再導致"
"在 Windows 上引發 :exc:`OSError` 例外。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:175
msgid ""
"Paths beginning with a slash are converted to URLs with authority sections. "
"For example, the path ``/etc/hosts`` is converted to the URL ``///etc/"
"hosts``."
msgstr ""
"以斜線開頭的路徑會被轉換為帶有 authority 部分的 URL。例如路徑 ``/etc/hosts`` "
"會被轉換為 URL ``///etc/hosts``。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:180
msgid "The *add_scheme* parameter was added."
msgstr "新增 *add_scheme* 參數。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:186
msgid ""
"Convert the given ``file:`` URL to a local path. This function "
"uses :func:`~urllib.parse.unquote` to decode the URL."
msgstr ""
"將給定的 ``file:`` URL 轉換為本機路徑。此函式使"
"用 :func:`~urllib.parse.unquote` 來解碼 URL。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:189
msgid ""
"If *require_scheme* is false (the default), the given value should omit a "
"``file:`` scheme prefix. If *require_scheme* is set to true, the given value "
"should include the prefix; a :exc:`~urllib.error.URLError` is raised if it "
"doesn't."
msgstr ""
"若 *require_scheme* 為 false（預設值），給定的值應省略 ``file:`` scheme 前"
"綴。若 *require_scheme* 設為 true，給定的值應包含該前綴；若未包含則會引"
"發 :exc:`~urllib.error.URLError`。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:194
msgid ""
"The URL authority is discarded if it is empty, ``localhost``, or the local "
"hostname. Otherwise, if *resolve_host* is set to true, the authority is "
"resolved using :func:`socket.gethostbyname` and discarded if it matches a "
"local IP address (as per :rfc:`RFC 8089 §3 <8089#section-3>`). If the "
"authority is still unhandled, then on Windows a UNC path is returned, and on "
"other platforms a :exc:`~urllib.error.URLError` is raised."
msgstr ""
"若 URL 的 authority 為空、為 ``localhost`` 或本機主機名稱，則會被捨棄。否則，"
"若 *resolve_host* 設為 true，則會使用 :func:`socket.gethostbyname` 解析該 "
"authority，並在其符合本機 IP 位址時捨棄（依據 :rfc:`RFC 8089 §3 "
"<8089#section-3>`）。若 authority 仍未被處理，則在 Windows 上會回傳 UNC 路"
"徑，在其他平台上則會引發 :exc:`~urllib.error.URLError`。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:203
msgid ""
">>> from urllib.request import url2pathname\n"
">>> url = 'file:///C:/Program%20Files'\n"
">>> url2pathname(url, require_scheme=True)\n"
"'C:\\\\Program Files'"
msgstr ""
">>> from urllib.request import url2pathname\n"
">>> url = 'file:///C:/Program%20Files'\n"
">>> url2pathname(url, require_scheme=True)\n"
"'C:\\\\Program Files'"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:213
msgid ""
"The URL authority is discarded if it matches the local hostname. Otherwise, "
"if the authority isn't empty or ``localhost``, then on Windows a UNC path is "
"returned (as before), and on other platforms a :exc:`~urllib.error.URLError` "
"is raised."
msgstr ""
"若 URL 的 authority 與本機主機名稱相符則會被捨棄。否則，若 authority 不為空也"
"不是 ``localhost``，則在 Windows 上會回傳 UNC 路徑（與先前相同），在其他平台"
"上則會引發 :exc:`~urllib.error.URLError`。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:219
msgid "The URL query and fragment components are discarded if present."
msgstr "URL 的 query 與 fragment 元件若存在則會被捨棄。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:222
msgid "The *require_scheme* and *resolve_host* parameters were added."
msgstr "新增 *require_scheme* 與 *resolve_host* 參數。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:228
msgid ""
"This helper function returns a dictionary of scheme to proxy server URL "
"mappings. It scans the environment for variables named ``<scheme>_proxy``, "
"in a case insensitive approach, for all operating systems first, and when it "
"cannot find it, looks for proxy information from System Configuration for "
"macOS and Windows Systems Registry for Windows. If both lowercase and "
"uppercase environment variables exist (and disagree), lowercase is preferred."
msgstr ""
"這個輔助函式 (helper function) 回傳一個代理伺服器 URL mappings（對映）的 "
"dictionary。在所有的作業系統中，它首先掃描環境中有著 ``<scheme>_proxy`` 名稱"
"的變數（忽略大小寫的），如果找不到的話就會在 macOS 中的系統設定 (System "
"Configuration) 或是 Windows 系統中的 Windows Systems Registry 尋找代理伺服器"
"設定。如果大小寫的環境變數同時存在且值有不同，小寫的環境變數會被選用。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:238
msgid ""
"If the environment variable ``REQUEST_METHOD`` is set, which usually "
"indicates your script is running in a CGI environment, the environment "
"variable ``HTTP_PROXY`` (uppercase ``_PROXY``) will be ignored. This is "
"because that variable can be injected by a client using the \"Proxy:\" HTTP "
"header. If you need to use an HTTP proxy in a CGI environment, either use "
"``ProxyHandler`` explicitly, or make sure the variable name is in lowercase "
"(or at least the ``_proxy`` suffix)."
msgstr ""
"如果環境變數 ``REQUEST_METHOD`` 有被設定（通常這代表著你的 script 是在一個共"
"用閘道介面 (CGI) 環境中執行），那麼環境變數 ``HTTP_PROXY`` （大寫的 "
"``_PROXY``）將被忽略。這是因為變數可以透過使用 \"Proxy:\" HTTP 標頭被注入。如"
"果需要在共用閘道介面環境中使用 HTTP 代理伺服器，可以明確使用 "
"``ProxyHandler``，亦或是確認變數名稱是小寫的（或至少 ``_proxy`` 後綴是小寫"
"的）。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:247
msgid "The following classes are provided:"
msgstr "提供了以下的 classes："

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:251
msgid "This class is an abstraction of a URL request."
msgstr "這個 class 是一個 URL 請求的抽象 class。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:253
msgid "*url* should be a string containing a valid, properly encoded URL."
msgstr "*url* 是一個包含有效且適當編碼的 URL 字串。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:255
msgid ""
"*data* must be an object specifying additional data to send to the server, "
"or ``None`` if no such data is needed.  Currently HTTP requests are the only "
"ones that use *data*.  The supported object types include bytes, file-like "
"objects, and iterables of bytes-like objects. If no ``Content-Length`` nor "
"``Transfer-Encoding`` header field has been provided, :class:`HTTPHandler` "
"will set these headers according to the type of *data*.  ``Content-Length`` "
"will be used to send bytes objects, while ``Transfer-Encoding: chunked`` as "
"specified in :rfc:`7230`, Section 3.3.1 will be used to send files and other "
"iterables."
msgstr ""
"*data* 必須是一個包含要送到伺服器的附加資料的物件，若不需帶附加資料則其值應"
"為 ``None``。目前 HTTP 請求是唯一有使用 *data* 參數的，其支援的物件型別包含位"
"元組、類檔案物件 (file-like objects)、以及可疊代的類位元組串物件 (bytes-like "
"objects)。如果沒有提供 ``Content-Length`` 及 ``Transfer-Encoding`` 標頭欄"
"位，:class:`HTTPHandler` 將會根據 *data* 的型別設定這些標頭。``Content-"
"Length`` 會被用來傳送位元組串物件，而 :rfc:`7230` 章節 3.3.1 所定義的 "
"``Transfer-Encoding: chunked`` 則會被用來傳送檔案或是其它可疊代物件 "
"(iterables)。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:265
msgid ""
"For an HTTP POST request method, *data* should be a buffer in the "
"standard :mimetype:`application/x-www-form-urlencoded` format.  "
"The :func:`urllib.parse.urlencode` function takes a mapping or sequence of 2-"
"tuples and returns an ASCII string in this format. It should be encoded to "
"bytes before being used as the *data* parameter."
msgstr ""
"對於一個 HTTP POST 請求方法，*data* 應為一個標準 :mimetype:`application/x-"
"www-form-urlencoded` 格式的 buffer。:func:`urllib.parse.urlencode` 方法接受一"
"個 mapping 或是 sequence（序列）的 2-tuples，並回傳一個對應格式的 ASCII 字"
"串。在被作為 *data* 參數前它應該被編碼成位元組串。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:271
msgid ""
"*headers* should be a dictionary, and will be treated as "
"if :meth:`add_header` was called with each key and value as arguments. This "
"is often used to \"spoof\" the ``User-Agent`` header value, which is used by "
"a browser to identify itself -- some HTTP servers only allow requests coming "
"from common browsers as opposed to scripts. For example, Mozilla Firefox may "
"identify itself as ``\"Mozilla/5.0 (X11; U; Linux i686) Gecko/20071127 "
"Firefox/2.0.0.11\"``, while :mod:`urllib`'s default user agent string is "
"``\"Python-urllib/2.6\"`` (on Python 2.6). All header keys are sent in camel "
"case."
msgstr ""
"*headers* 必須是一個 dictionary，並會被視為如同每對 key 和 value 作為引數來呼"
"叫 :meth:`add_header`。經常用於「偽裝」\\ ``User-Agent`` 標頭的值，這個標頭是"
"用來讓一個瀏覽器向伺服器表明自己的身分 --- 有些 HTTP 伺服器僅允許來自普通瀏覽"
"器的請求，而不接受來自程式腳本的請求。例如，Mozilla Firefox 會將該標頭的值設"
"為 ``\"Mozilla/5.0 (X11; U; Linux i686) Gecko/20071127 Firefox/2.0.0.11\"``，"
"而 :mod:`urllib` 的值則是 ``\"Python-urllib/2.6\"``\\ （在 Python 2.6 上）。"
"所有標頭的鍵都會以 camel case（駝峰式大小寫）來傳送。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:282
msgid ""
"An appropriate ``Content-Type`` header should be included if the *data* "
"argument is present.  If this header has not been provided and *data* is not "
"``None``, ``Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded`` will be added "
"as a default."
msgstr ""
"當有給定 *data* 引數時，一個適當的 ``Content-Type`` 標頭應該被設定。如果這個"
"標頭沒有被提供且 *data* 也不為 ``None`` 時，預設值 ``Content-Type: "
"application/x-www-form-urlencoded`` 會被新增至請求中。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:287
msgid ""
"The next two arguments are only of interest for correct handling of third-"
"party HTTP cookies:"
msgstr ""
"接下來的兩個引數的介紹提供給那些有興趣正確處理第三方 HTTP cookies 的使用者："

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:290
msgid ""
"*origin_req_host* should be the request-host of the origin transaction, as "
"defined by :rfc:`2965`.  It defaults to "
"``http.cookiejar.request_host(self)``.  This is the host name or IP address "
"of the original request that was initiated by the user. For example, if the "
"request is for an image in an HTML document, this should be the request-host "
"of the request for the page containing the image."
msgstr ""
"*origin_req_host* 應為原始傳輸互動的請求主機 (request-host)，如同"
"在 :rfc:`2965` 中的定義。預設值為 ``http.cookiejar.request_host(self)``。這是"
"使用者發起的原始請求的主機名稱或是 IP 位址。例如當請求是要求一個 HTML 文件中"
"的一個影像，則這個屬性應為請求包含影像頁面的請求主機。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:298
msgid ""
"*unverifiable* should indicate whether the request is unverifiable, as "
"defined by :rfc:`2965`.  It defaults to ``False``.  An unverifiable request "
"is one whose URL the user did not have the option to approve.  For example, "
"if the request is for an image in an HTML document, and the user had no "
"option to approve the automatic fetching of the image, this should be true."
msgstr ""
"*unverifiable* 應該標示一個請求是否是無法驗證的，如同在 :rfc:`2965` 中的定"
"義。其預設值為 ``False``。一個無法驗證的請求是指使用者沒有機會去批准請求的 "
"URL，例如一個對於 HTML 文件中的影像所做的請求，而使用者沒有機會去批准是否能自"
"動擷取影像，則這個值應該為 true。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:305
msgid ""
"*method* should be a string that indicates the HTTP request method that will "
"be used (e.g. ``'HEAD'``).  If provided, its value is stored in "
"the :attr:`~Request.method` attribute and is used by :meth:`get_method`. The "
"default is ``'GET'`` if *data* is ``None`` or ``'POST'`` otherwise. "
"Subclasses may indicate a different default method by setting "
"the :attr:`~Request.method` attribute in the class itself."
msgstr ""
"*method* 應為一個標示 HTTP 請求方法的字串（例如：``'HEAD'``）。如果有提供值，"
"則會被存在 :attr:`~Request.method` 屬性中且被 :meth:`get_method` 所使用。當 "
"*data* 是 ``None`` 時，其預設值為 ``'GET'``，否則預設值為 ``'POST'``。"
"Subclasses 可以透過設定其 :attr:`~Request.method` 屬性來指定不一樣的預設請求"
"方法。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:313
msgid ""
"The request will not work as expected if the data object is unable to "
"deliver its content more than once (e.g. a file or an iterable that can "
"produce the content only once) and the request is retried for HTTP redirects "
"or authentication.  The *data* is sent to the HTTP server right away after "
"the headers.  There is no support for a 100-continue expectation in the "
"library."
msgstr ""
"如果資料物件無法重複提供其內容（例如一個檔案或是只能產生一次內容的可疊代物"
"件）且請求因為 HTTP 重新導向 (redirects) 或是 HTTP 驗證 (authentication) 而被"
"重新嘗試傳送，則該請求不會正常運作。*data* 會接在標頭之後被送至 HTTP 伺服器。"
"此函式庫沒有支援 100-continue expectation。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:320
msgid ":attr:`Request.method` argument is added to the Request class."
msgstr "新增 :attr:`Request.method` 引數到 Request class。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:323
msgid "Default :attr:`Request.method` may be indicated at the class level."
msgstr "能夠在 class 中設定預設的 :attr:`Request.method`。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:326
msgid ""
"Do not raise an error if the ``Content-Length`` has not been provided and "
"*data* is neither ``None`` nor a bytes object. Fall back to use chunked "
"transfer encoding instead."
msgstr ""
"如果 ``Content-Length`` 尚未被提供且 *data* 既不是 ``None`` 也不是一個位元組"
"串物件，則不會觸發錯誤，並 fall back（後備）使用分塊傳輸編碼 (chunked "
"transfer encoding)。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:333
msgid ""
"The :class:`OpenerDirector` class opens URLs via :class:`BaseHandler`\\ s "
"chained together. It manages the chaining of handlers, and recovery from "
"errors."
msgstr ""
":class:`OpenerDirector` 類別透過串接在一起的 :class:`BaseHandler` 來開啟 "
"URL。它負責管理處理器的串接，以及從錯誤中復原。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:339
msgid ""
"This is the base class for all registered handlers --- and handles only the "
"simple mechanics of registration."
msgstr "這是所有已註冊處理器的基底類別 --- 並且只處理註冊的簡單機制。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:345
msgid ""
"A class which defines a default handler for HTTP error responses; all "
"responses are turned into :exc:`~urllib.error.HTTPError` exceptions."
msgstr ""
"一個為 HTTP 錯誤回應定義預設處理器的類別；所有回應都會被轉換"
"為 :exc:`~urllib.error.HTTPError` 例外。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:351
msgid "A class to handle redirections."
msgstr "用於處理重新導向的類別。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:356
msgid "A class to handle HTTP Cookies."
msgstr "用於處理 HTTP Cookie 的類別。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:361
msgid ""
"Cause requests to go through a proxy. If *proxies* is given, it must be a "
"dictionary mapping protocol names to URLs of proxies. The default is to read "
"the list of proxies from the environment variables ``<protocol>_proxy``.  If "
"no proxy environment variables are set, then in a Windows environment proxy "
"settings are obtained from the registry's Internet Settings section, and in "
"a macOS environment proxy information is retrieved from the System "
"Configuration Framework."
msgstr ""
"使請求經由代理伺服器傳送。若有給定 *proxies*，它必須是一個將協定名稱對映到代"
"理伺服器 URL 的字典。預設會從環境變數 ``<protocol>_proxy`` 讀取代理伺服器清"
"單。若未設定任何代理伺服器環境變數，則在 Windows 環境中會從登錄檔的網際網路設"
"定 (Internet Settings) 區段取得代理伺服器設定，在 macOS 環境中則會從系統組態"
"框架 (System Configuration Framework) 取得代理伺服器資訊。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:369
msgid "To disable autodetected proxy pass an empty dictionary."
msgstr "若要停用自動偵測到的代理伺服器，請傳入一個空字典。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:371
msgid ""
"The :envvar:`no_proxy` environment variable can be used to specify hosts "
"which shouldn't be reached via proxy; if set, it should be a comma-separated "
"list of hostname suffixes, optionally with ``:port`` appended, for example "
"``cern.ch,ncsa.uiuc.edu,some.host:8080``."
msgstr ""
":envvar:`no_proxy` 環境變數可用來指定不應經由代理伺服器連線的主機；若有設定，"
"它應為以逗號分隔的主機名稱後綴清單，後綴可選擇性地加上 ``:port``，例如 "
"``cern.ch,ncsa.uiuc.edu,some.host:8080``。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:378
msgid ""
"``HTTP_PROXY`` will be ignored if a variable ``REQUEST_METHOD`` is set; see "
"the documentation on :func:`~urllib.request.getproxies`."
msgstr ""
"若有設定變數 ``REQUEST_METHOD``，則 ``HTTP_PROXY`` 會被忽略；請參"
"閱 :func:`~urllib.request.getproxies` 的說明文件。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:381
msgid ""
"Because *proxies* holds at most one proxy for each protocol, it cannot use a "
"proxy auto-config (PAC) file, which selects a proxy for each URL.  "
"See :ref:`this example <urllib-request-pac>` for one way to use a PAC file."
msgstr ""
"由於 *proxies* 對每個協定最多只保存一個代理伺服器，因此無法使用為每個 URL 各"
"自選擇代理伺服器的代理伺服器自動設定 (proxy auto-config, PAC) 檔案。關於使用 "
"PAC 檔案的一種方式，請參閱\\ :ref:`此範例 <urllib-request-pac>`。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:389
msgid "Keep a database of  ``(realm, uri) -> (user, password)`` mappings."
msgstr "維護一個 ``(realm, uri) -> (user, password)`` 對映的資料庫。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:394
msgid ""
"Keep a database of  ``(realm, uri) -> (user, password)`` mappings. A realm "
"of ``None`` is considered a catch-all realm, which is searched if no other "
"realm fits."
msgstr ""
"維護一個 ``(realm, uri) -> (user, password)`` 對映的資料庫。realm 為 "
"``None`` 時會被視為萬用的 realm，在沒有其他 realm 符合時會搜尋它。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:401
msgid ""
"A variant of :class:`HTTPPasswordMgrWithDefaultRealm` that also has a "
"database of ``uri -> is_authenticated`` mappings.  Can be used by a "
"BasicAuth handler to determine when to send authentication credentials "
"immediately instead of waiting for a ``401`` response first."
msgstr ""
":class:`HTTPPasswordMgrWithDefaultRealm` 的一個變體，另外還有一個 ``uri -> "
"is_authenticated`` 對映的資料庫。可供 BasicAuth 處理器用來判斷何時應立即傳送"
"認證資訊 (credentials)，而不是先等待 ``401`` 回應。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:411
msgid ""
"This is a mixin class that helps with HTTP authentication, both to the "
"remote host and to a proxy. *password_mgr*, if given, should be something "
"that is compatible with :class:`HTTPPasswordMgr`; refer to "
"section :ref:`http-password-mgr` for information on the interface that must "
"be supported.  If *passwd_mgr* also provides ``is_authenticated`` and "
"``update_authenticated`` methods (see :ref:`http-password-mgr-with-prior-"
"auth`), then the handler will use the ``is_authenticated`` result for a "
"given URI to determine whether or not to send authentication credentials "
"with the request.  If ``is_authenticated`` returns ``True`` for the URI, "
"credentials are sent.  If ``is_authenticated`` is ``False``, credentials are "
"not sent, and then if a ``401`` response is received the request is re-sent "
"with the authentication credentials.  If authentication succeeds, "
"``update_authenticated`` is called to set ``is_authenticated`` ``True`` for "
"the URI, so that subsequent requests to the URI itself or any path below it "
"will automatically include the authentication credentials."
msgstr ""
"這是一個 mixin 類別，用於協助對遠端主機與代理伺服器進行 HTTP 驗證。若有給定 "
"*password_mgr*，它應為與 :class:`HTTPPasswordMgr` 相容的物件；關於其必須支援"
"的介面資訊，請參閱 :ref:`http-password-mgr`。若 *passwd_mgr* 也提供 "
"``is_authenticated`` 與 ``update_authenticated`` 方法（請參閱 :ref:`http-"
"password-mgr-with-prior-auth`），則處理器會使用給定 URI 的 "
"``is_authenticated`` 結果，來判斷是否要隨請求傳送認證資訊。若 "
"``is_authenticated`` 對該 URI 回傳 ``True``，則會傳送認證資訊。若 "
"``is_authenticated`` 為 ``False``，則不會傳送認證資訊，之後若收到 ``401`` 回"
"應，便會帶著認證資訊重新傳送請求。若驗證成功，則會呼叫 "
"``update_authenticated`` 將該 URI 的 ``is_authenticated`` 設為 ``True``，使後"
"續對該 URI 本身或其下任何路徑的請求都會自動包含認證資訊。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:428
msgid "Added ``is_authenticated`` support."
msgstr "新增 ``is_authenticated`` 的支援。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:434
msgid ""
"Handle authentication with the remote host. *password_mgr*, if given, should "
"be something that is compatible with :class:`HTTPPasswordMgr`; refer to "
"section :ref:`http-password-mgr` for information on the interface that must "
"be supported. HTTPBasicAuthHandler will raise a :exc:`ValueError` when "
"presented with a wrong Authentication scheme."
msgstr ""
"處理與遠端主機之間的驗證。若有給定 *password_mgr*，它應為"
"與 :class:`HTTPPasswordMgr` 相容的物件；關於其必須支援的介面資訊，請參"
"閱 :ref:`http-password-mgr`。當遇到錯誤的驗證方案 (Authentication scheme) "
"時，HTTPBasicAuthHandler 會引發 :exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:443 ../../library/urllib.request.rst:480
msgid ""
"Handle authentication with the proxy. *password_mgr*, if given, should be "
"something that is compatible with :class:`HTTPPasswordMgr`; refer to "
"section :ref:`http-password-mgr` for information on the interface that must "
"be supported."
msgstr ""
"處理與代理伺服器之間的驗證。若有給定 *password_mgr*，它應為"
"與 :class:`HTTPPasswordMgr` 相容的物件；關於其必須支援的介面資訊，請參"
"閱 :ref:`http-password-mgr`。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:451
msgid ""
"This is a mixin class that helps with HTTP authentication, both to the "
"remote host and to a proxy. *password_mgr*, if given, should be something "
"that is compatible with :class:`HTTPPasswordMgr`; refer to "
"section :ref:`http-password-mgr` for information on the interface that must "
"be supported."
msgstr ""
"這是一個 mixin 類別，用於協助對遠端主機與代理伺服器進行 HTTP 驗證。若有給定 "
"*password_mgr*，它應為與 :class:`HTTPPasswordMgr` 相容的物件；關於其必須支援"
"的介面資訊，請參閱 :ref:`http-password-mgr`。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:457
msgid "Added support for HTTP digest authentication algorithm ``SHA-256``."
msgstr "新增對 HTTP digest 驗證演算法 ``SHA-256`` 的支援。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:463
msgid ""
"Handle authentication with the remote host. *password_mgr*, if given, should "
"be something that is compatible with :class:`HTTPPasswordMgr`; refer to "
"section :ref:`http-password-mgr` for information on the interface that must "
"be supported. When both Digest Authentication Handler and Basic "
"Authentication Handler are both added, Digest Authentication is always tried "
"first. If the Digest Authentication returns a 40x response again, it is sent "
"to Basic Authentication handler to Handle.  This Handler method will raise "
"a :exc:`ValueError` when presented with an authentication scheme other than "
"Digest or Basic."
msgstr ""
"處理與遠端主機之間的驗證。若有給定 *password_mgr*，它應為"
"與 :class:`HTTPPasswordMgr` 相容的物件；關於其必須支援的介面資訊，請參"
"閱 :ref:`http-password-mgr`。當 Digest 驗證處理器與 Basic 驗證處理器都被加入"
"時，一律會先嘗試 Digest 驗證。若 Digest 驗證再次回傳 40x 回應，則會交由 "
"Basic 驗證處理器處理。當遇到 Digest 或 Basic 以外的驗證方案時，此處理器方法會"
"引發 :exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:473
msgid "Raise :exc:`ValueError` on unsupported Authentication Scheme."
msgstr "針對不支援的驗證方案 (Authentication Scheme) 引發 :exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:488
msgid "A class to handle opening of HTTP URLs."
msgstr "用於處理開啟 HTTP URL 的類別。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:493
msgid ""
"A class to handle opening of HTTPS URLs.  *context* and *check_hostname* "
"have the same meaning as in :class:`http.client.HTTPSConnection`."
msgstr ""
"用於處理開啟 HTTPS URL 的類別。*context* 與 *check_hostname* 的意義"
"與 :class:`http.client.HTTPSConnection` 中的相同。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:496
msgid "*context* and *check_hostname* were added."
msgstr "新增 *context* 與 *check_hostname*。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:502
msgid "Open local files."
msgstr "開啟本機檔案。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:506
msgid "Open data URLs."
msgstr "開啟 data URL。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:512
msgid "Open FTP URLs."
msgstr "打開 FTP URLs。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:517
msgid ""
"Open FTP URLs, keeping a cache of open FTP connections to minimize delays."
msgstr "開啟 FTP URL，並保留已開啟 FTP 連線的快取以減少延遲。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:522
msgid "A catch-all class to handle unknown URLs."
msgstr "用於處理未知 URL 的萬用類別。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:527 ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1249
msgid "Process HTTP error responses."
msgstr "處理 HTTP 錯誤回應。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:533
msgid "Request Objects"
msgstr "Request 物件"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:535
msgid ""
"The following methods describe :class:`Request`'s public interface, and so "
"all may be overridden in subclasses.  It also defines several public "
"attributes that can be used by clients to inspect the parsed request."
msgstr ""
"以下方法描述了 :class:`Request` 的公開介面，因此全都可以在子類別中被覆寫。它"
"也定義了數個公開屬性，可供呼叫端用來檢查剖析後的請求。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:542
msgid "The original URL passed to the constructor."
msgstr "傳給建構函式的原始 URL。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:546
msgid ""
"Request.full_url is a property with setter, getter and a deleter. "
"Getting :attr:`~Request.full_url` returns the original request URL with the "
"fragment, if it was present."
msgstr ""
"Request.full_url 是一個帶有 setter、getter 與 deleter 的特性。取"
"得 :attr:`~Request.full_url` 會回傳原始的請求 URL，若原本有 fragment 也會一併"
"包含。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:552
msgid "The URI scheme."
msgstr "URI scheme。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:556
msgid ""
"The URI authority, typically a host, but may also contain a port separated "
"by a colon."
msgstr "URI authority，通常是一個主機，但也可能包含以冒號分隔的連接埠。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:561
msgid "The original host for the request, without port."
msgstr "請求的原始主機，不含連接埠。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:565
msgid ""
"The URI path.  If the :class:`Request` uses a proxy, then selector will be "
"the full URL that is passed to the proxy."
msgstr ""
"URI 路徑。若 :class:`Request` 使用代理伺服器，則 selector 會是傳給代理伺服器"
"的完整 URL。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:570
msgid "The entity body for the request, or ``None`` if not specified."
msgstr "請求的實體主體 (entity body)，若未指定則為 ``None``。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:572
msgid ""
"Changing value of :attr:`Request.data` now deletes \"Content-Length\" header "
"if it was previously set or calculated."
msgstr ""
"現在改變 :attr:`Request.data` 的值時，若先前已設定或計算過「Content-Length」"
"標頭，則會將其刪除。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:578
msgid ""
"boolean, indicates whether the request is unverifiable as defined "
"by :rfc:`2965`."
msgstr "布林值，表示該請求是否為 :rfc:`2965` 所定義的無法驗證的請求。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:583
msgid ""
"The HTTP request method to use.  By default its value is :const:`None`, "
"which means that :meth:`~Request.get_method` will do its normal computation "
"of the method to be used.  Its value can be set (thus overriding the default "
"computation in :meth:`~Request.get_method`) either by providing a default "
"value by setting it at the class level in a :class:`Request` subclass, or by "
"passing a value in to the :class:`Request` constructor via the *method* "
"argument."
msgstr ""
"要使用的 HTTP 請求方法。其值預設為 :const:`None`，表"
"示 :meth:`~Request.get_method` 會照常計算要使用的方法。要設定其值（從而覆"
"寫 :meth:`~Request.get_method` 中的預設計算），可以在 :class:`Request` 子類別"
"中於類別層級設定預設值，或透過 *method* 引數將值傳給 :class:`Request` 建構函"
"式。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:593
msgid ""
"A default value can now be set in subclasses; previously it could only be "
"set via the constructor argument."
msgstr "現在可以在子類別中設定預設值；先前只能透過建構函式引數設定。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:600
msgid ""
"Return a string indicating the HTTP request method.  "
"If :attr:`Request.method` is not ``None``, return its value, otherwise "
"return ``'GET'`` if :attr:`Request.data` is ``None``, or ``'POST'`` if it's "
"not. This is only meaningful for HTTP requests."
msgstr ""
"回傳一個表示 HTTP 請求方法的字串。若 :attr:`Request.method` 不為 ``None``，則"
"回傳其值；否則在 :attr:`Request.data` 為 ``None`` 時回傳 ``'GET'``，不是時回"
"傳 ``'POST'``。這只對 HTTP 請求有意義。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:605
msgid "get_method now looks at the value of :attr:`Request.method`."
msgstr "get_method 現在會查看 :attr:`Request.method` 的值。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:611
msgid ""
"Add another header to the request.  Headers are currently ignored by all "
"handlers except HTTP handlers, where they are added to the list of headers "
"sent to the server.  Note that there cannot be more than one header with the "
"same name, and later calls will overwrite previous calls in case the *key* "
"collides. Currently, this is no loss of HTTP functionality, since all "
"headers which have meaning when used more than once have a (header-specific) "
"way of gaining the same functionality using only one header.  Note that "
"headers added using this method are also added to redirected requests."
msgstr ""
"為請求新增另一個標頭。目前除了 HTTP 處理器以外，所有處理器都會忽略標頭；HTTP "
"處理器會將標頭加入傳送給伺服器的標頭清單中。請注意，同名的標頭不能超過一個，"
"若 *key* 發生衝突，後面的呼叫會覆寫前面的呼叫。目前這並不會損失任何 HTTP 功"
"能，因為所有在多次使用時才有意義的標頭，都有（該標頭特有的）方式能只用一個標"
"頭達到相同的功能。請注意，使用此方法加入的標頭也會被加入重新導向後的請求中。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:623
msgid "Add a header that will not be added to a redirected request."
msgstr "新增一個不會被加入重新導向後請求中的標頭。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:628
msgid ""
"Return whether the instance has the named header (checks both regular and "
"unredirected)."
msgstr ""
"回傳該實例是否具有指定名稱的標頭（會同時檢查一般標頭與不重新導向的標頭）。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:634
msgid ""
"Remove named header from the request instance (both from regular and "
"unredirected headers)."
msgstr "從請求實例中移除指定名稱的標頭（一般標頭與不重新導向的標頭都會移除）。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:642
msgid "Return the URL given in the constructor."
msgstr "回傳在建構函式中給定的 URL。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:646
msgid "Returns :attr:`Request.full_url`"
msgstr "回傳 :attr:`Request.full_url`"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:651
msgid ""
"Prepare the request by connecting to a proxy server. The *host* and *type* "
"will replace those of the instance, and the instance's selector will be the "
"original URL given in the constructor."
msgstr ""
"透過連線到代理伺服器來準備請求。*host* 與 *type* 會取代實例原本的值，而實例"
"的 selector 會是在建構函式中給定的原始 URL。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:658
msgid ""
"Return the value of the given header. If the header is not present, return "
"the default value."
msgstr "回傳給定標頭的值。若該標頭不存在，則回傳預設值。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:664
msgid ""
"Return a list of tuples (header_name, header_value) of the Request headers."
msgstr "回傳由 Request 標頭組成的 tuple (header_name, header_value) 串列。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:666
msgid ""
"The request methods add_data, has_data, get_data, get_type, get_host, "
"get_selector, get_origin_req_host and is_unverifiable that were deprecated "
"since 3.3 have been removed."
msgstr ""
"自 3.3 起已棄用的 Request 方法 add_data、has_data、get_data、get_type、"
"get_host、get_selector、get_origin_req_host 與 is_unverifiable 已被移除。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:675
msgid "OpenerDirector Objects"
msgstr "OpenerDirector 物件"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:677
msgid ":class:`OpenerDirector` instances have the following methods:"
msgstr ":class:`OpenerDirector` 物件有以下的方法："

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:682
msgid ""
"*handler* should be an instance of :class:`BaseHandler`.  The following "
"methods are searched, and added to the possible chains (note that HTTP "
"errors are a special case).  Note that, in the following, *protocol* should "
"be replaced with the actual protocol to handle, for "
"example :meth:`http_response` would be the HTTP protocol response handler.  "
"Also *type* should be replaced with the actual HTTP code, for "
"example :meth:`http_error_404` would handle HTTP 404 errors."
msgstr ""
"*handler* 應為 :class:`BaseHandler` 的實例。會搜尋以下方法，並將其加入可能的"
"處理鏈中（請注意 HTTP 錯誤是特殊情況）。請注意，在下文中，*protocol* 應替換為"
"實際要處理的協定，例如 :meth:`http_response` 即為 HTTP 協定的回應處理器。同樣"
"地，*type* 應替換為實際的 HTTP 狀態碼，例如 :meth:`http_error_404` 會處理 "
"HTTP 404 錯誤。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:690
msgid ""
":meth:`!<protocol>_open` --- signal that the handler knows how to open "
"*protocol* URLs."
msgstr ":meth:`!<protocol>_open` --- 表示該處理器知道如何開啟 *protocol* URL。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:693
msgid "See |protocol_open|_ for more information."
msgstr "更多資訊請見 |protocol_open|_。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:695
msgid ""
":meth:`!http_error_\\<type\\>` --- signal that the handler knows how to "
"handle HTTP errors with HTTP error code *type*."
msgstr ""
":meth:`!http_error_\\<type\\>` --- 表示該處理器知道如何處理 HTTP 錯誤碼為 "
"*type* 的 HTTP 錯誤。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:698
msgid "See |http_error_nnn|_ for more information."
msgstr "更多資訊請見 |http_error_nnn|_。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:700
msgid ""
":meth:`!<protocol>_error` --- signal that the handler knows how to handle "
"errors from (non-\\ ``http``) *protocol*."
msgstr ""
":meth:`!<protocol>_error` --- 表示該處理器知道如何處理來自 *protocol*\\ （非 "
"``http``）的錯誤。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:703
msgid ""
":meth:`!<protocol>_request` --- signal that the handler knows how to pre-"
"process *protocol* requests."
msgstr ""
":meth:`!<protocol>_request` --- 表示該處理器知道如何前處理 *protocol* 請求。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:706
msgid "See |protocol_request|_ for more information."
msgstr "更多資訊請見 |protocol_request|_。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:708
msgid ""
":meth:`!<protocol>_response` --- signal that the handler knows how to post-"
"process *protocol* responses."
msgstr ""
":meth:`!<protocol>_response` --- 表示該處理器知道如何後處理 *protocol* 回應。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:711
msgid "See |protocol_response|_ for more information."
msgstr "更多資訊請見 |protocol_response|_。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:720
msgid ""
"Open the given *url* (which can be a request object or a string), optionally "
"passing the given *data*. Arguments, return values and exceptions raised are "
"the same as those of :func:`urlopen` (which simply calls the :meth:`open` "
"method on the currently installed global :class:`OpenerDirector`).  The "
"optional *timeout* parameter specifies a timeout in seconds for blocking "
"operations like the connection attempt (if not specified, the global default "
"timeout setting will be used). The timeout feature actually works only for "
"HTTP, HTTPS and FTP connections."
msgstr ""
"開啟給定的 *url*\\ （可以是請求物件或字串），並可選擇性地傳入給定的 *data*。"
"引數、回傳值與引發的例外皆與 :func:`urlopen` 相同（它只是呼叫目前安裝的全"
"域 :class:`OpenerDirector` 的 :meth:`open` 方法）。選擇性參數 *timeout* 指定"
"阻塞性操作（如嘗試連線）的超時時間，以秒為單位（若未指定，則會使用全域預設超"
"時時間設定）。超時功能實際上僅作用於 HTTP、HTTPS 以及 FTP 的連線。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:732
msgid ""
"Handle an error of the given protocol.  This will call the registered error "
"handlers for the given protocol with the given arguments (which are protocol "
"specific).  The HTTP protocol is a special case which uses the HTTP response "
"code to determine the specific error handler; refer to the :meth:`!"
"http_error_\\<type\\>` methods of the handler classes."
msgstr ""
"處理給定協定的錯誤。這會以給定的引數（因協定而異）呼叫該協定已註冊的錯誤處理"
"器。HTTP 協定是特殊情況，它會使用 HTTP 回應狀態碼來決定特定的錯誤處理器；請參"
"閱各處理器類別的 :meth:`!http_error_\\<type\\>` 方法。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:738
msgid ""
"Return values and exceptions raised are the same as those of :func:`urlopen`."
msgstr "回傳值與引發的例外皆與 :func:`urlopen` 相同。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:740
msgid "OpenerDirector objects open URLs in three stages:"
msgstr "OpenerDirector 物件分三個階段開啟 URL："

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:742
msgid ""
"The order in which these methods are called within each stage is determined "
"by sorting the handler instances."
msgstr "在每個階段中，這些方法的呼叫順序是由處理器實例的排序決定的。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:745
msgid ""
"Every handler with a method named like :meth:`!<protocol>_request` has that "
"method called to pre-process the request."
msgstr ""
"每個具有名稱形如 :meth:`!<protocol>_request` 方法的處理器，都會呼叫該方法來前"
"處理請求。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:748
msgid ""
"Handlers with a method named like :meth:`!<protocol>_open` are called to "
"handle the request. This stage ends when a handler either returns a non-"
"\\ :const:`None` value (ie. a response), or raises an exception "
"(usually :exc:`~urllib.error.URLError`).  Exceptions are allowed to "
"propagate."
msgstr ""
"具有名稱形如 :meth:`!<protocol>_open` 方法的處理器會被呼叫來處理請求。當某個"
"處理器回傳非 :const:`None` 的值（即回應）或引發例外（通常"
"是 :exc:`~urllib.error.URLError`）時，此階段即結束。例外可以向上傳播。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:753
msgid ""
"In fact, the above algorithm is first tried for methods "
"named :meth:`~BaseHandler.default_open`.  If all such methods "
"return :const:`None`, the algorithm is repeated for methods named "
"like :meth:`!<protocol>_open`.  If all such methods return :const:`None`, "
"the algorithm is repeated for methods "
"named :meth:`~BaseHandler.unknown_open`."
msgstr ""
"事實上，上述演算法會先對名為 :meth:`~BaseHandler.default_open` 的方法進行嘗"
"試。若所有這類方法都回傳 :const:`None`，則會對名稱形如 :meth:`!"
"<protocol>_open` 的方法重複此演算法。若所有這類方法都回傳 :const:`None`，則會"
"再對名為 :meth:`~BaseHandler.unknown_open` 的方法重複此演算法。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:759
msgid ""
"Note that the implementation of these methods may involve calls of the "
"parent :class:`OpenerDirector` instance's :meth:`~OpenerDirector.open` "
"and :meth:`~OpenerDirector.error` methods."
msgstr ""
"請注意，這些方法的實作可能會呼叫上層 :class:`OpenerDirector` 實例"
"的 :meth:`~OpenerDirector.open` 與 :meth:`~OpenerDirector.error` 方法。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:763
msgid ""
"Every handler with a method named like :meth:`!<protocol>_response` has that "
"method called to post-process the response."
msgstr ""
"每個具有名稱形如 :meth:`!<protocol>_response` 方法的處理器，都會呼叫該方法來"
"後處理回應。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:770
msgid "BaseHandler Objects"
msgstr "BaseHandler 物件"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:772
msgid ""
":class:`BaseHandler` objects provide a couple of methods that are directly "
"useful, and others that are meant to be used by derived classes.  These are "
"intended for direct use:"
msgstr ""
":class:`BaseHandler` 物件提供了幾個可以直接使用的方法，以及其他供衍生類別使用"
"的方法。以下方法是供直接使用的："

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:779
msgid "Add a director as parent."
msgstr "新增一個 director 作為上層物件。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:784
msgid "Remove any parents."
msgstr "移除所有上層物件。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:786
msgid ""
"The following attribute and methods should only be used by classes derived "
"from :class:`BaseHandler`."
msgstr "以下屬性與方法應只由衍生自 :class:`BaseHandler` 的類別使用。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:791
msgid ""
"The convention has been adopted that subclasses defining :meth:`!"
"<protocol>_request` or :meth:`!<protocol>_response` methods are "
"named :class:`!\\*Processor`; all others are named :class:`!\\*Handler`."
msgstr ""
"慣例上，定義 :meth:`!<protocol>_request` 或 :meth:`!<protocol>_response` 方法"
"的子類別會命名為 :class:`!\\*Processor`；其他所有子類別則命名為 :class:`!"
"\\*Handler`。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:798
msgid ""
"A valid :class:`OpenerDirector`, which can be used to open using a different "
"protocol, or handle errors."
msgstr ""
"一個有效的 :class:`OpenerDirector`，可用來以不同的協定開啟，或處理錯誤。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:804
msgid ""
"This method is *not* defined in :class:`BaseHandler`, but subclasses should "
"define it if they want to catch all URLs."
msgstr ""
"此方法\\ *並未*\\ 在 :class:`BaseHandler` 中定義，但若子類別想要捕捉所有 "
"URL，就應該定義它。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:807
msgid ""
"This method, if implemented, will be called by the "
"parent :class:`OpenerDirector`.  It should return a file-like object as "
"described in the return value of the :meth:`~OpenerDirector.open` method "
"of :class:`OpenerDirector`, or ``None``. It should "
"raise :exc:`~urllib.error.URLError`, unless a truly exceptional thing "
"happens (for example, :exc:`MemoryError` should not be mapped "
"to :exc:`~urllib.error.URLError`)."
msgstr ""
"若有實作此方法，它會被上層的 :class:`OpenerDirector` 呼叫。它應回傳一個"
"如 :class:`OpenerDirector` 的 :meth:`~OpenerDirector.open` 方法回傳值所描述的"
"類檔案物件，或回傳 ``None``。除非發生真正非比尋常的狀況，否則它應引"
"發 :exc:`~urllib.error.URLError`\\ （例如 :exc:`MemoryError` 不應被對映"
"為 :exc:`~urllib.error.URLError`）。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:814
msgid "This method will be called before any protocol-specific open method."
msgstr "此方法會在任何協定專屬的 open 方法之前被呼叫。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:821
msgid ""
"This method is *not* defined in :class:`BaseHandler`, but subclasses should "
"define it if they want to handle URLs with the given protocol."
msgstr ""
"此方法\\ *並未*\\ 在 :class:`BaseHandler` 中定義，但若子類別想要處理給定協定"
"的 URL，就應該定義它。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:824
msgid ""
"This method, if defined, will be called by the "
"parent :class:`OpenerDirector`. Return values should be the same as "
"for  :meth:`~BaseHandler.default_open`."
msgstr ""
"若有定義此方法，它會被上層的 :class:`OpenerDirector` 呼叫。回傳值應"
"與 :meth:`~BaseHandler.default_open` 相同。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:830
msgid ""
"This method is *not* defined in :class:`BaseHandler`, but subclasses should "
"define it if they want to catch all URLs with no specific registered handler "
"to open it."
msgstr ""
"此方法\\ *並未*\\ 在 :class:`BaseHandler` 中定義，但若子類別想要捕捉所有沒有"
"特定已註冊處理器可開啟的 URL，就應該定義它。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:834
msgid ""
"This method, if implemented, will be called by "
"the :attr:`parent` :class:`OpenerDirector`.  Return values should be the "
"same as for :meth:`default_open`."
msgstr ""
"若有實作此方法，它會被 :attr:`parent` :class:`OpenerDirector` 呼叫。回傳值應"
"與 :meth:`default_open` 相同。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:841
msgid ""
"This method is *not* defined in :class:`BaseHandler`, but subclasses should "
"override it if they intend to provide a catch-all for otherwise unhandled "
"HTTP errors.  It will be called automatically by "
"the  :class:`OpenerDirector` getting the error, and should not normally be "
"called in other circumstances."
msgstr ""
"此方法\\ *並未*\\ 在 :class:`BaseHandler` 中定義，但若子類別打算為沒有其他處"
"理器處理的 HTTP 錯誤提供萬用處理，就應該覆寫它。它會由收到該錯誤"
"的 :class:`OpenerDirector` 自動呼叫，一般而言不應在其他情況下呼叫。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:846
msgid ""
":class:`OpenerDirector` will call this method with five positional arguments:"
msgstr ":class:`OpenerDirector` 會以五個位置引數呼叫此方法："

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:848
msgid "a :class:`Request` object,"
msgstr "一個 :class:`Request` 物件"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:849
msgid "a file-like object with the HTTP error body,"
msgstr "一個類檔案物件，包含 HTTP 錯誤主體，"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:850
msgid "the three-digit code of the error, as an integer,"
msgstr "HTTP 錯誤的三位數錯誤碼，為一個整數，"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:851
msgid "the user-visible explanation of the code, as a string, and"
msgstr "HTTP 錯誤碼的使用者可見解釋字串，以及"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:852
msgid "the headers of the error, as a mapping object."
msgstr "HTTP 錯誤的標頭，為一個對映物件。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:854
msgid ""
"Return values and exceptions raised should be the same as those "
"of :func:`urlopen`."
msgstr "回傳值與引發的例外應與 :func:`urlopen` 相同。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:861
msgid ""
"*nnn* should be a three-digit HTTP error code.  This method is also not "
"defined in :class:`BaseHandler`, but will be called, if it exists, on an "
"instance of a subclass, when an HTTP error with code *nnn* occurs."
msgstr ""
"*nnn* 應為三位數的 HTTP 錯誤碼。此方法同樣未在 :class:`BaseHandler` 中定義，"
"但若子類別的實例上存在此方法，則在發生錯誤碼為 *nnn* 的 HTTP 錯誤時會呼叫它。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:865
msgid "Subclasses should override this method to handle specific HTTP errors."
msgstr "子類別應覆寫此方法以處理特定的 HTTP 錯誤。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:867
msgid ""
"Arguments, return values and exceptions raised should be the same as "
"for :meth:`~BaseHandler.http_error_default`."
msgstr ""
"引數、回傳值與引發的例外應與 :meth:`~BaseHandler.http_error_default` 相同。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:875
msgid ""
"This method is *not* defined in :class:`BaseHandler`, but subclasses should "
"define it if they want to pre-process requests of the given protocol."
msgstr ""
"此方法\\ *並未*\\ 在 :class:`BaseHandler` 中定義，但若子類別想要前處理給定協"
"定的請求，就應該定義它。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:878
msgid ""
"This method, if defined, will be called by the "
"parent :class:`OpenerDirector`. *req* will be a :class:`Request` object. The "
"return value should be a :class:`Request` object."
msgstr ""
"若有定義此方法，它會被上層的 :class:`OpenerDirector` 呼叫。*req* 會是一"
"個 :class:`Request` 物件。回傳值應為一個 :class:`Request` 物件。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:887
msgid ""
"This method is *not* defined in :class:`BaseHandler`, but subclasses should "
"define it if they want to post-process responses of the given protocol."
msgstr ""
"此方法\\ *並未*\\ 在 :class:`BaseHandler` 中定義，但若子類別想要後處理給定協"
"定的回應，就應該定義它。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:890
msgid ""
"This method, if defined, will be called by the "
"parent :class:`OpenerDirector`. *req* will be a :class:`Request` object. "
"*response* will be an object implementing the same interface as the return "
"value of :func:`urlopen`.  The return value should implement the same "
"interface as the return value of :func:`urlopen`."
msgstr ""
"若有定義此方法，它會被上層的 :class:`OpenerDirector` 呼叫。*req* 會是一"
"個 :class:`Request` 物件。*response* 會是一個實作了與 :func:`urlopen` 回傳值"
"相同介面的物件。回傳值應實作與 :func:`urlopen` 回傳值相同的介面。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:900
msgid "HTTPRedirectHandler Objects"
msgstr "HTTPRedirectHandler 物件"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:904
msgid ""
"Some HTTP redirections require action from this module's client code.  If "
"this is the case, :exc:`~urllib.error.HTTPError` is raised.  See :rfc:`2616` "
"for details of the precise meanings of the various redirection codes."
msgstr ""
"某些 HTTP 重新導向需要使用此模組的程式碼採取行動。在這種情況下會引"
"發 :exc:`~urllib.error.HTTPError`。關於各種重新導向狀態碼的確切意義，詳"
"見 :rfc:`2616`。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:908
msgid ""
"An :exc:`~urllib.error.HTTPError` exception raised as a security "
"consideration if the HTTPRedirectHandler is presented with a redirected URL "
"which is not an HTTP, HTTPS or FTP URL."
msgstr ""
"基於安全考量，若 HTTPRedirectHandler 收到的重新導向 URL 不是 HTTP、HTTPS 或 "
"FTP URL，則會引發 :exc:`~urllib.error.HTTPError` 例外。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:915
msgid ""
"Return a :class:`Request` or ``None`` in response to a redirect. This is "
"called by the default implementations of the :meth:`!http_error_30\\*` "
"methods when a redirection is received from the server.  If a redirection "
"should take place, return a new :class:`Request` to allow :meth:`!"
"http_error_30\\*` to perform the redirect to *newurl*.  Otherwise, "
"raise :exc:`~urllib.error.HTTPError` if no other handler should try to "
"handle this URL, or return ``None`` if you can't but another handler might."
msgstr ""
"回傳一個 :class:`Request` 或 ``None`` 以回應重新導向。當從伺服器收到重新導向"
"時，:meth:`!http_error_30\\*` 方法的預設實作會呼叫此方法。若應進行重新導向，"
"則回傳一個新的 :class:`Request`，讓 :meth:`!http_error_30\\*` 執行到 "
"*newurl* 的重新導向。否則，若不應有其他處理器嘗試處理此 URL，則引"
"發 :exc:`~urllib.error.HTTPError`；若你無法處理但其他處理器可能可以，則回傳 "
"``None``。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:925
msgid ""
"The default implementation of this method does not strictly "
"follow :rfc:`2616`, which says that 301 and 302 responses to ``POST`` "
"requests must not be automatically redirected without confirmation by the "
"user.  In reality, browsers do allow automatic redirection of these "
"responses, changing the POST to a ``GET``, and the default implementation "
"reproduces this behavior."
msgstr ""
"此方法的預設實作並未嚴格遵循 :rfc:`2616`；該規範指出，對 ``POST`` 請求的 301 "
"與 302 回應，在未經使用者確認前不得自動重新導向。實際上，瀏覽器確實會自動重新"
"導向這些回應，並將 POST 改為 ``GET``，而預設實作重現了此行為。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:934
msgid ""
"Redirect to the ``Location:`` or ``URI:`` URL.  This method is called by the "
"parent :class:`OpenerDirector` when getting an HTTP 'moved permanently' "
"response."
msgstr ""
"重新導向到 ``Location:`` 或 ``URI:`` URL。當收到 HTTP「moved permanently」回"
"應時，上層的 :class:`OpenerDirector` 會呼叫此方法。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:940
msgid ""
"The same as :meth:`http_error_301`, but called for the 'found' response."
msgstr "與 :meth:`http_error_301` 相同，但用於「found」回應。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:945
msgid ""
"The same as :meth:`http_error_301`, but called for the 'see other' response."
msgstr "與 :meth:`http_error_301` 相同，但用於「see other」回應。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:950
msgid ""
"The same as :meth:`http_error_301`, but called for the 'temporary redirect' "
"response. It does not allow changing the request method from ``POST`` to "
"``GET``."
msgstr ""
"與 :meth:`http_error_301` 相同，但用於「temporary redirect」回應。它不允許將"
"請求方法從 ``POST`` 改為 ``GET``。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:957
msgid ""
"The same as :meth:`http_error_301`, but called for the 'permanent redirect' "
"response. It does not allow changing the request method from ``POST`` to "
"``GET``."
msgstr ""
"與 :meth:`http_error_301` 相同，但用於「permanent redirect」回應。它不允許將"
"請求方法從 ``POST`` 改為 ``GET``。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:967
msgid "HTTPCookieProcessor Objects"
msgstr "HTTPCookieProcessor 物件"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:969
msgid ":class:`HTTPCookieProcessor` instances have one attribute:"
msgstr ":class:`HTTPCookieProcessor` 實例有一個屬性："

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:973
msgid "The :class:`http.cookiejar.CookieJar` in which cookies are stored."
msgstr "存放 cookies 的 :class:`http.cookiejar.CookieJar`。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:979
msgid "ProxyHandler Objects"
msgstr "ProxyHandler 物件"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:985
msgid ""
"The :class:`ProxyHandler` will have a method :meth:`!<protocol>_open` for "
"every *protocol* which has a proxy in the *proxies* dictionary given in the "
"constructor.  The method will modify requests to go through the proxy, by "
"calling ``request.set_proxy()``, and call the next handler in the chain to "
"actually execute the protocol."
msgstr ""
"對於在建構函式中給定的 *proxies* 字典裡有代理伺服器的每個 "
"*protocol*，:class:`ProxyHandler` 都會有一個 :meth:`!<protocol>_open` 方法。"
"該方法會透過呼叫 ``request.set_proxy()`` 修改請求，使其經由代理伺服器傳送，並"
"呼叫鏈中的下一個處理器來實際執行該協定。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:995
msgid "HTTPPasswordMgr Objects"
msgstr "HTTPPasswordMgr 物件"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:997
msgid ""
"These methods are available on :class:`HTTPPasswordMgr` "
"and :class:`HTTPPasswordMgrWithDefaultRealm` objects."
msgstr ""
"以下方法可用於 :class:`HTTPPasswordMgr` "
"與 :class:`HTTPPasswordMgrWithDefaultRealm` 物件。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1003
msgid ""
"*uri* can be either a single URI, or a sequence of URIs. *realm*, *user* and "
"*passwd* must be strings. The credentials for *realm* apply to any "
"registered URI and to paths below it. If a URI includes a scheme, its "
"credentials only match authentication URIs with the same scheme or no "
"scheme. A URI without a scheme matches authentication URIs with any scheme."
msgstr ""
"*uri* 可以是單一 URI，也可以是 URI 的序列。*realm*、*user* 與 *passwd* 必須是"
"字串。*realm* 的認證資訊適用於任何已註冊的 URI 及其下的路徑。若 URI 包含 "
"scheme，則其認證資訊只會符合 scheme 相同或沒有 scheme 的驗證 URI。沒有 "
"scheme 的 URI 則會符合任何 scheme 的驗證 URI。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1009
msgid ""
"Authentication credentials for URIs with a scheme are now scoped by that "
"scheme."
msgstr "帶有 scheme 的 URI 的認證資訊，現在會以該 scheme 限定其適用範圍。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1016
msgid ""
"Get user/password for given realm and URI, if any.  This method will return "
"``(None, None)`` if there is no matching user/password."
msgstr ""
"取得給定 realm 與 URI 的使用者名稱／密碼（如果有的話）。若沒有相符的使用者名"
"稱／密碼，此方法會回傳 ``(None, None)``。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1019
msgid ""
"For :class:`HTTPPasswordMgrWithDefaultRealm` objects, the realm ``None`` "
"will be searched if the given *realm* has no matching user/password."
msgstr ""
"對於 :class:`HTTPPasswordMgrWithDefaultRealm` 物件，若給定的 *realm* 沒有相符"
"的使用者名稱／密碼，則會搜尋 realm ``None``。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1026
msgid "HTTPPasswordMgrWithPriorAuth Objects"
msgstr "HTTPPasswordMgrWithPriorAuth 物件"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1028
msgid ""
"This password manager extends :class:`HTTPPasswordMgrWithDefaultRealm` to "
"support tracking URIs for which authentication credentials should always be "
"sent."
msgstr ""
"此密碼管理器擴充了 :class:`HTTPPasswordMgrWithDefaultRealm`，以支援追蹤那些應"
"一律傳送認證資訊的 URI。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1035
msgid ""
"*realm*, *uri*, *user*, *passwd* are as "
"for :meth:`HTTPPasswordMgr.add_password`.  *is_authenticated* sets the "
"initial value of the ``is_authenticated`` flag for the given URI or list of "
"URIs. If *is_authenticated* is specified as ``True``, *realm* is ignored."
msgstr ""
"*realm*、*uri*、*user*、*passwd* 與 :meth:`HTTPPasswordMgr.add_password` 中的"
"相同。*is_authenticated* 會為給定的 URI 或 URI 串列設定 ``is_authenticated`` "
"旗標的初始值。若 *is_authenticated* 指定為 ``True``，則 *realm* 會被忽略。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1043
msgid "Same as for :class:`HTTPPasswordMgrWithDefaultRealm` objects"
msgstr "與 :class:`HTTPPasswordMgrWithDefaultRealm` 物件的相同"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1049
msgid ""
"Update the ``is_authenticated`` flag for the given *uri* or list of URIs."
msgstr "更新給定的 *uri* 或 URI 串列的 ``is_authenticated`` 旗標。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1055
msgid ""
"Returns the current state of the ``is_authenticated`` flag for the given URI."
msgstr "回傳給定 URI 的 ``is_authenticated`` 旗標的目前狀態。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1062
msgid "AbstractBasicAuthHandler Objects"
msgstr "AbstractBasicAuthHandler 物件"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1067
msgid ""
"Handle an authentication request by getting a user/password pair, and re-"
"trying the request.  *authreq* should be the name of the header where the "
"information about the realm is included in the request, *host* specifies the "
"URL and path to authenticate for, *req* should be the "
"(failed) :class:`Request` object, and *headers* should be the error headers."
msgstr ""
"透過取得一組使用者名稱／密碼並重試請求，來處理驗證請求。*authreq* 應為請求中"
"包含 realm 資訊的標頭名稱，*host* 指定要進行驗證的 URL 與路徑，*req* 應為（失"
"敗的）\\ :class:`Request` 物件，而 *headers* 應為錯誤標頭。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1073
msgid ""
"*headers* must be a mapping-like object with case-insensitive lookup that "
"implements the ``get_all()`` method, such as :class:`email.message.Message` "
"or :class:`wsgiref.headers.Headers`."
msgstr ""
"*headers* 必須是一個支援不區分大小寫查找、並實作了 ``get_all()`` 方法的類對映"
"物件，例如 :class:`email.message.Message` "
"或 :class:`wsgiref.headers.Headers`。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1077
msgid ""
"*host* is either an authority (e.g. ``\"python.org\"``) or a URL containing "
"an authority component (e.g. ``\"https://python.org/\"``). In either case, "
"the authority must not contain a userinfo component (so, ``\"python.org\"`` "
"and ``\"python.org:80\"`` are fine, ``\"joe:password@python.org\"`` is not)."
msgstr ""
"*host* 可以是一個 authority（例如 ``\"python.org\"``），或是包含 authority 元"
"件的 URL（例如 ``\"https://python.org/\"``）。無論哪種情況，authority 都不得"
"包含 userinfo 元件（因此 ``\"python.org\"`` 與 ``\"python.org:80\"`` 是可以"
"的，``\"joe:password@python.org\"`` 則不行）。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1086
msgid "HTTPBasicAuthHandler Objects"
msgstr "HTTPBasicAuthHandler 物件"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1091 ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1102
#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1130 ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1141
msgid "Retry the request with authentication information, if available."
msgstr "若有可用的驗證資訊，則帶著該資訊重試請求。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1097
msgid "ProxyBasicAuthHandler Objects"
msgstr "ProxyBasicAuthHandler 物件"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1108
msgid "AbstractDigestAuthHandler Objects"
msgstr "AbstractDigestAuthHandler 物件"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1113
msgid ""
"*authreq* should be the name of the header where the information about the "
"realm is included in the request, *host* should be the host to authenticate "
"to, *req* should be the (failed) :class:`Request` object, and *headers* "
"should be the error headers."
msgstr ""
"*authreq* 應為請求中包含 realm 資訊的標頭名稱，*host* 應為要進行驗證的主機，"
"*req* 應為（失敗的）\\ :class:`Request` 物件，而 *headers* 應為錯誤標頭。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1118
msgid ""
"*headers* must be a mapping-like object with case-insensitive lookup, such "
"as :class:`email.message.Message` or :class:`wsgiref.headers.Headers`."
msgstr ""
"*headers* 必須是一個支援不區分大小寫查找的類對映物件，例"
"如 :class:`email.message.Message` 或 :class:`wsgiref.headers.Headers`。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1125
msgid "HTTPDigestAuthHandler Objects"
msgstr "HTTPDigestAuthHandler 物件"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1136
msgid "ProxyDigestAuthHandler Objects"
msgstr "ProxyDigestAuthHandler 物件"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1147
msgid "HTTPHandler Objects"
msgstr "HTTPHandler 物件"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1152
msgid ""
"Send an HTTP request, which can be either GET or POST, depending on "
"``req.data``."
msgstr "傳送一個 HTTP 請求，依 ``req.data`` 而定，可以是 GET 或 POST。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1159
msgid "HTTPSHandler Objects"
msgstr "HTTPSHandler 物件"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1164
msgid ""
"Send an HTTPS request, which can be either GET or POST, depending on "
"``req.data``."
msgstr "傳送一個 HTTPS 請求，依 ``req.data`` 而定，可以是 GET 或 POST。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1171
msgid "FileHandler Objects"
msgstr "FileHandler 物件"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1176
msgid ""
"Open the file locally, if there is no host name, or the host name is "
"``'localhost'``."
msgstr "若沒有主機名稱，或主機名稱為 ``'localhost'``，則在本機開啟該檔案。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1179
msgid ""
"This method is applicable only for local hostnames.  When a remote hostname "
"is given, a :exc:`~urllib.error.URLError` is raised."
msgstr ""
"此方法只適用於本機主機名稱。若給定的是遠端主機名稱，則會引"
"發 :exc:`~urllib.error.URLError`。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1187
msgid "DataHandler Objects"
msgstr "DataHandler 物件"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1191
msgid ""
"Read a data URL. This kind of URL contains the content encoded in the URL "
"itself. The data URL syntax is specified in :rfc:`2397`. This implementation "
"ignores white spaces in base64 encoded data URLs so the URL may be wrapped "
"in whatever source file it comes from. But even though some browsers don't "
"mind about a missing padding at the end of a base64 encoded data URL, this "
"implementation will raise a :exc:`ValueError` in that case."
msgstr ""
"讀取 data URL。這類 URL 將內容編碼於 URL 本身之中。data URL 的語法規範"
"於 :rfc:`2397`。此實作會忽略 base64 編碼 data URL 中的空白，因此無論 URL 來自"
"哪個原始檔，都可以被換行。不過，即使某些瀏覽器不在意 base64 編碼的 data URL "
"結尾缺少填充 (padding)，此實作在這種情況下仍會引發 :exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1202
msgid "FTPHandler Objects"
msgstr "FTPHandler 物件"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1207
msgid ""
"Open the FTP file indicated by *req*. The username and password are taken "
"from the URL, with missing values defaulting to empty strings. "
"See :meth:`ftplib.FTP.login` for the login defaults."
msgstr ""
"開啟 *req* 所指的 FTP 檔案。使用者名稱與密碼取自 URL，缺少的值預設為空字串。"
"登入的預設值請參閱 :meth:`ftplib.FTP.login`。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1215
msgid "CacheFTPHandler Objects"
msgstr "CacheFTPHandler 物件"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1217
msgid ""
":class:`CacheFTPHandler` objects are :class:`FTPHandler` objects with the "
"following additional methods:"
msgstr ""
":class:`CacheFTPHandler` 物件是額外具有以下方法的 :class:`FTPHandler` 物件："

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1223
msgid "Set timeout of connections to *t* seconds."
msgstr "將連線的超時時間設為 *t* 秒。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1228
msgid "Set maximum number of cached connections to *m*."
msgstr "將快取連線的最大數量設為 *m*。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1234
msgid "UnknownHandler Objects"
msgstr "UnknownHandler 物件"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1239
msgid "Raise a :exc:`~urllib.error.URLError` exception."
msgstr "引發 :exc:`~urllib.error.URLError` 例外。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1245
msgid "HTTPErrorProcessor Objects"
msgstr "HTTPErrorProcessor 物件"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1251
msgid "For 2xx status codes, the response object is returned immediately."
msgstr "對於 2xx 狀態碼，會立即回傳該回應物件。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1253
msgid ""
"For other status codes, this simply passes the job on to the :meth:`!"
"http_error_\\<type\\>` handler methods, via :meth:`OpenerDirector.error`. "
"Eventually, :class:`HTTPDefaultErrorHandler` will raise "
"an :exc:`~urllib.error.HTTPError` if no other handler handles the error."
msgstr ""
"對於其他狀態碼，這只是透過 :meth:`OpenerDirector.error` 將工作轉交給 :meth:`!"
