#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1274
msgid ""
"This example gets the python.org main page and displays the first 300 bytes "
"of it::"
msgstr "此範例取得 python.org 首頁並顯示其前 300 個位元組： ::"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1277
msgid ""
">>> import urllib.request\n"
">>> with urllib.request.urlopen('https://www.python.org/') as f:\n"
"...     # The response may be compressed (for example, 'gzip').\n"
"...     print(f.headers.get('Content-Encoding'))\n"
"...     data = f.read()\n"
"...     if f.headers.get('Content-Encoding') == 'gzip':\n"
"...         import gzip\n"
"...         data = gzip.decompress(data)\n"
"...     print(data[:300].decode('utf-8', errors='replace'))"
msgstr ""
">>> import urllib.request\n"
">>> with urllib.request.urlopen('https://www.python.org/') as f:\n"
"...     # 回應可能經過壓縮（例如 'gzip'）。\n"
"...     print(f.headers.get('Content-Encoding'))\n"
"...     data = f.read()\n"
"...     if f.headers.get('Content-Encoding') == 'gzip':\n"
"...         import gzip\n"
"...         data = gzip.decompress(data)\n"
"...     print(data[:300].decode('utf-8', errors='replace'))"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1287
msgid ""
"Note that calling ``read()`` on the response returned by :func:`urlopen` "
"returns a :class:`bytes` object.  This is because there is no way "
"for :func:`urlopen` to automatically determine the encoding of the byte "
"stream it receives from the HTTP server. In general, a program will decode "
"the returned bytes object to a string once it determines or guesses the "
"appropriate encoding."
msgstr ""
"請注意，對 :func:`urlopen` 回傳的回應呼叫 ``read()`` 會回傳一"
"個 :class:`bytes` 物件。這是因為 :func:`urlopen` 無法自動判斷它從 HTTP 伺服器"
"收到的位元組串流的編碼。一般而言，程式會在判斷出或猜測出適當的編碼後，將回傳"
"的位元組物件解碼為字串。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1293
