"International/questions/qa-html-encoding-declarations."
msgstr ""
"更多資訊請參閱 W3C 文件：https://www.w3.org/International/questions/qa-html-"
"encoding-declarations。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1299
msgid ""
"As the python.org website uses *utf-8* encoding as specified in its meta "
"tag, we will use the same for decoding the bytes object::"
msgstr ""
"由於 python.org 網站使用其 meta 標籤中所指定的 *utf-8* 編碼，我們也將使用同樣"
"的編碼來解碼位元組物件： ::"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1302
msgid ""
">>> with urllib.request.urlopen('https://www.python.org/') as f:\n"
"...     # Check for compression and decode appropriately.\n"
"...     enc = f.headers.get('Content-Encoding')\n"
"...     data = f.read()\n"
"...     if enc == 'gzip':\n"
"...         import gzip\n"
"...         data = gzip.decompress(data)\n"
"...     print(data[:100].decode('utf-8', errors='replace'))\n"
"..."
msgstr ""
">>> with urllib.request.urlopen('https://www.python.org/') as f:\n"
"...     # 檢查是否經過壓縮並適當地解碼。\n"
"...     enc = f.headers.get('Content-Encoding')\n"
"...     data = f.read()\n"
"...     if enc == 'gzip':\n"
"...         import gzip\n"
"...         data = gzip.decompress(data)\n"
"...     print(data[:100].decode('utf-8', errors='replace'))\n"
"..."

