#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1371
msgid ""
":func:`build_opener` provides many handlers by default, including "
"a :class:`ProxyHandler`.  By default, :class:`ProxyHandler` uses the "
"environment variables named ``<scheme>_proxy``, where ``<scheme>`` is the "
"URL scheme involved.  For example, the :envvar:`!http_proxy` environment "
"variable is read to obtain the HTTP proxy's URL."
msgstr ""
":func:`build_opener` 預設提供了許多處理器，其中包"
"括 :class:`ProxyHandler`。:class:`ProxyHandler` 預設會使用名為 "
"``<scheme>_proxy`` 的環境變數，其中 ``<scheme>`` 是所涉及的 URL scheme。例"
"如，會讀取 :envvar:`!http_proxy` 環境變數來取得 HTTP 代理伺服器的 URL。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1377
