"with opener.open('http://www.example.com/login.html') as f:\n"
"   print(f.read().decode('utf-8'))"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1392
msgid ""
"Proxy auto-config (PAC) files select a proxy for each URL, so they cannot be "
"described by the *proxies* mapping that :class:`ProxyHandler` expects.  "
"The :pypi:`pypac` package finds and evaluates PAC files; its "
"``ProxyResolver`` can be used to write a handler that consults the PAC file "
"once per request::"
msgstr ""
"代理伺服器自動設定 (PAC) 檔案會為每個 URL 選擇代理伺服器，因此無法"
"以 :class:`ProxyHandler` 所預期的 *proxies* 對映來描述。:pypi:`pypac` 套件可"
"以尋找並執行 PAC 檔案；它的 ``ProxyResolver`` 可用來撰寫一個在每次請求時查詢"
"一次 PAC 檔案的處理器： ::"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1397
msgid ""
"import urllib.error\n"
"import urllib.request\n"
"from pypac import get_pac\n"
"from pypac.resolver import ProxyResolver\n"
"\n"
"class PACProxyHandler(urllib.request.ProxyHandler):\n"
"\n"
"    def __init__(self, resolver):\n"
"        self.resolver = resolver\n"
"        # An empty mapping suppresses the <protocol>_open methods that\n"
"        # ProxyHandler would make from a static proxies mapping.\n"
"        super().__init__({})\n"
"\n"
"    def _pac_open(self, req, protocol):\n"
"        proxy = self.resolver.get_proxy(req.full_url)\n"
"        if proxy is None:\n"
"            raise urllib.error.URLError('no proxy available')\n"
"        if proxy == 'DIRECT':\n"
"            return None  # continue with the remaining handlers\n"
"        if proxy.startswith('socks'):\n"
"            raise urllib.error.URLError('SOCKS proxies are not supported')\n"
"        return self.proxy_open(req, proxy, protocol)\n"
"\n"
"    def http_open(self, req):\n"
"        return self._pac_open(req, 'http')\n"
"\n"
"    def https_open(self, req):\n"
"        return self._pac_open(req, 'https')\n"
"\n"
"opener = "
"urllib.request.build_opener(PACProxyHandler(ProxyResolver(get_pac())))\n"
"with opener.open('http://www.example.com/') as f:\n"
"    print(f.read().decode('utf-8'))"
msgstr ""
"import urllib.error\n"
"import urllib.request\n"
"from pypac import get_pac\n"
"from pypac.resolver import ProxyResolver\n"
"\n"
"class PACProxyHandler(urllib.request.ProxyHandler):\n"
"\n"
"    def __init__(self, resolver):\n"
"        self.resolver = resolver\n"
"        # 空的對映會抑制 ProxyHandler 原本會根據靜態 proxies\n"
"        # 對映建立的 <protocol>_open 方法。\n"
"        super().__init__({})\n"
"\n"
"    def _pac_open(self, req, protocol):\n"
"        proxy = self.resolver.get_proxy(req.full_url)\n"
"        if proxy is None:\n"
"            raise urllib.error.URLError('no proxy available')\n"
"        if proxy == 'DIRECT':\n"
"            return None  # 繼續交由其餘的處理器處理\n"
"        if proxy.startswith('socks'):\n"
"            raise urllib.error.URLError('SOCKS proxies are not supported')\n"
"        return self.proxy_open(req, proxy, protocol)\n"
"\n"
"    def http_open(self, req):\n"
"        return self._pac_open(req, 'http')\n"
"\n"
"    def https_open(self, req):\n"
"        return self._pac_open(req, 'https')\n"
"\n"
"opener = "
"urllib.request.build_opener(PACProxyHandler(ProxyResolver(get_pac())))\n"
"with opener.open('http://www.example.com/') as f:\n"
"    print(f.read().decode('utf-8'))"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1430
msgid ""
"Note that a PAC file may also select a SOCKS proxy, "
"which :mod:`urllib.request` cannot use, and that the :envvar:`no_proxy` "
"environment variable and the operating system's proxy bypass list still "
"apply to requests the PAC file assigned to a proxy."
msgstr ""
"請注意，PAC 檔案也可能選擇 :mod:`urllib.request` 無法使用的 SOCKS 代理伺服"
"器；此外，對於 PAC 檔案指派給代理伺服器的請求，:envvar:`no_proxy` 環境變數與"
"作業系統的代理伺服器略過清單 (bypass list) 仍然適用。"

