msgstr ""
">>> import urllib.request\n"
">>> proxies = {'https': 'http://proxy.example.com:8080/'}\n"
">>> opener = "
"urllib.request.build_opener(urllib.request.ProxyHandler(proxies))\n"
">>> with opener.open(\"https://www.python.org\") as f:\n"
"...     f.read().decode('utf-8')\n"
"..."

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1496
msgid ""
"The following example uses no proxies at all, overriding environment "
"settings::"
msgstr "以下範例完全不使用代理伺服器，覆寫環境設定： ::"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1498
msgid ""
">>> import urllib.request\n"
">>> opener = urllib.request.build_opener(urllib.request.ProxyHandler({}))\n"
">>> with opener.open(\"https://www.python.org/\") as f:\n"
"...     f.read().decode('utf-8')\n"
"..."
msgstr ""
">>> import urllib.request\n"
">>> opener = urllib.request.build_opener(urllib.request.ProxyHandler({}))\n"
">>> with opener.open(\"https://www.python.org/\") as f:\n"
"...     f.read().decode('utf-8')\n"
"..."

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1506
msgid "Legacy interface"
msgstr "遺留介面"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1508
msgid ""
"The following functions and classes are ported from the Python 2 module "
"``urllib`` (as opposed to ``urllib2``).  They might become deprecated at "
"some point in the future."
msgstr ""
"以下函式與類別是從 Python 2 的 ``urllib`` 模組（而非 ``urllib2``）移植過來"
"的。它們可能會在未來某個時間點被棄用。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1514
msgid ""
"Copy a network object denoted by a URL to a local file. If the URL points to "
"a local file, the object will not be copied unless filename is supplied. "
"Return a tuple ``(filename, headers)`` where *filename* is the local file "
"name under which the object can be found, and *headers* is whatever "
"the :meth:`!info` method of the object returned by :func:`urlopen` returned "
"(for a remote object). Exceptions are the same as for :func:`urlopen`."
msgstr ""
"將 URL 所表示的網路物件複製到本機檔案。若 URL 指向本機檔案，則除非有提供 "
"filename，否則不會複製該物件。回傳一個 tuple ``(filename, headers)``，其中 "
"*filename* 是可以找到該物件的本機檔案名稱，而 *headers* 是 :func:`urlopen` 所"
"回傳物件的 :meth:`!info` 方法的回傳值（對於遠端物件）。例外"
"與 :func:`urlopen` 的相同。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1521
msgid ""
"The second argument, if present, specifies the file location to copy to (if "
"absent, the location will be a tempfile with a generated name). The third "
"argument, if present, is a callable that will be called once on "
"establishment of the network connection and once after each block read "
"thereafter.  The callable will be passed three arguments; a count of blocks "
"transferred so far, a block size in bytes, and the total size of the file.  "
"The third argument may be ``-1`` on older FTP servers which do not return a "
"file size in response to a retrieval request."
msgstr ""
"第二個引數（若有）指定要複製到的檔案位置（若沒有，則位置會是一個具有自動產生"
"名稱的暫存檔）。第三個引數（若有）是一個可呼叫物件，會在建立網路連線時呼叫一"
"次，之後每讀取一個區塊就再呼叫一次。該可呼叫物件會被傳入三個引數：目前已傳輸"
"的區塊數、以位元組為單位的區塊大小，以及檔案的總大小。在不會針對擷取請求回傳"
"檔案大小的舊型 FTP 伺服器上，第三個引數可能會是 ``-1``。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1530
msgid "The following example illustrates the most common usage scenario::"
msgstr "以下範例說明了最常見的使用情境： ::"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1532
msgid ""
">>> import urllib.request\n"
">>> local_filename, headers = urllib.request.urlretrieve('https://"
"python.org/')\n"
">>> html = open(local_filename)\n"
">>> html.close()"
msgstr ""
">>> import urllib.request\n"
">>> local_filename, headers = urllib.request.urlretrieve('https://"
"python.org/')\n"
">>> html = open(local_filename)\n"
">>> html.close()"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1537
msgid ""
"If the *url* uses the :file:`http:` scheme identifier, the optional *data* "
"argument may be given to specify a ``POST`` request (normally the request "
"type is ``GET``).  The *data* argument must be a bytes object in "
"standard :mimetype:`application/x-www-form-urlencoded` format; see "
"the :func:`urllib.parse.urlencode` function."
msgstr ""
"若 *url* 使用 :file:`http:` scheme 識別字，則可以給定選擇性的 *data* 引數來指"
"定 ``POST`` 請求（一般的請求類型為 ``GET``）。*data* 引數必須是標"
"準 :mimetype:`application/x-www-form-urlencoded` 格式的位元組物件；請參"
"閱 :func:`urllib.parse.urlencode` 函式。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1543
msgid ""
":func:`urlretrieve` will raise :exc:`~urllib.error.ContentTooShortError` "
"when it detects that the amount of data available  was less than the "
"expected amount (which is the size reported by a  *Content-Length* header). "
"This can occur, for example, when the  download is interrupted."
msgstr ""
"當 :func:`urlretrieve` 偵測到可用的資料量少於預期的量（即 *Content-Length* 標"
"頭所回報的大小）時，會引發 :exc:`~urllib.error.ContentTooShortError`。例如，"
"這可能發生在下載中斷時。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1548
msgid ""
"The *Content-Length* is treated as a lower bound: if there's more data  to "
"read, urlretrieve reads more data, but if less data is available,  it raises "
"the exception."
msgstr ""
"*Content-Length* 會被視為下限：若有更多資料可讀取，urlretrieve 會讀取更多資"
"料；但若可用的資料較少，則會引發該例外。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1552
msgid ""
"You can still retrieve the downloaded data in this case, it is stored in "
"the :attr:`!content` attribute of the exception instance."
msgstr ""
"在這種情況下你仍然可以取得已下載的資料，它存放在例外實例的 :attr:`!content` "
"屬性中。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1555
msgid ""
"If no *Content-Length* header was supplied, urlretrieve can not check the "
"size of the data it has downloaded, and just returns it.  In this case you "
"just have to assume that the download was successful."
msgstr ""
"若未提供 *Content-Length* 標頭，urlretrieve 便無法檢查已下載資料的大小，只會"
"直接回傳它。在這種情況下，你只能假設下載是成功的。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1561
msgid ""
"Cleans up temporary files that may have been left behind by previous calls "
"to :func:`urlretrieve`.  It also resets the default global opener installed "
"by :func:`install_opener`."
msgstr ""
"清除先前呼叫 :func:`urlretrieve` 時可能遺留下來的暫存檔。它也會重設"
"由 :func:`install_opener` 安裝的預設全域 opener。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1567
msgid ":mod:`!urllib.request` Restrictions"
msgstr ":mod:`!urllib.request` 限制"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1573
msgid ""
"Currently, only the following protocols are supported: HTTP (versions 0.9 "
"and 1.0), FTP, local files, and data URLs."
msgstr ""
"目前只支援以下協定：HTTP（0.9 與 1.0 版）、FTP、本機檔案以及 data URL。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1576
msgid "Added support for data URLs."
msgstr "新增對 data URL 的支援。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1578
msgid ""
"The caching feature of :func:`urlretrieve` has been disabled until someone "
"finds the time to hack proper processing of Expiration time headers."
msgstr ""
":func:`urlretrieve` 的快取功能已被停用，直到有人有時間實作對過期時間 "
"(Expiration time) 標頭的正確處理為止。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1581
msgid ""
"There should be a function to query whether a particular URL is in the cache."
msgstr "應該要有一個函式可以查詢特定 URL 是否在快取中。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1583
msgid ""
"For backward compatibility, if a URL appears to point to a local file but "
"the file can't be opened, the URL is re-interpreted using the FTP protocol.  "
"This can sometimes cause confusing error messages."
msgstr ""
"為了向後相容，若某個 URL 看似指向本機檔案但該檔案無法開啟，則會改用 FTP 協定"
"重新解讀該 URL。這有時會導致令人困惑的錯誤訊息。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1587
msgid ""
"The :func:`urlopen` and :func:`urlretrieve` functions can cause arbitrarily "
"long delays while waiting for a network connection to be set up.  This means "
"that it is difficult to build an interactive web client using these "
"functions without using threads."
msgstr ""
":func:`urlopen` 與 :func:`urlretrieve` 函式在等待網路連線建立時，可能會造成任"
"意長的延遲。這意味著若不使用執行緒，就很難用這些函式建構互動式的 Web 用戶端。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1596
msgid ""
"The data returned by :func:`urlopen` or :func:`urlretrieve` is the raw data "
"returned by the server.  This may be binary data (such as an image), plain "
"text or (for example) HTML.  The HTTP protocol provides type information in "
"the reply header, which can be inspected by looking at "
"the :mailheader:`Content-Type` header.  If the returned data is HTML, you "
"can use the module :mod:`html.parser` to parse it."
msgstr ""
":func:`urlopen` 或 :func:`urlretrieve` 回傳的資料是伺服器回傳的原始資料。它可"
"能是二進位資料（例如影像）、純文字，或（例如）HTML。HTTP 協定會在回應標頭中提"
"供內容類型資訊，可透過查看 :mailheader:`Content-Type` 標頭來檢查。若回傳的資"
"料是 HTML，你可以使用 :mod:`html.parser` 模組來剖析它。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1605
msgid ""
"The code handling the FTP protocol cannot differentiate between a file and a "
"directory.  This can lead to unexpected behavior when attempting to read a "
"URL that points to a file that is not accessible.  If the URL ends in a ``/"
"``, it is assumed to refer to a directory and will be handled accordingly.  "
"But if an attempt to read a file leads to a 550 error (meaning the URL "
"cannot be found or is not accessible, often for permission reasons), then "
"the path is treated as a directory in order to handle the case when a "
"directory is specified by a URL but the trailing ``/`` has been left off.  "
"This can cause misleading results when you try to fetch a file whose read "
"permissions make it inaccessible; the FTP code will try to read it, fail "
"with a 550 error, and then perform a directory listing for the unreadable "
"file. If fine-grained control is needed, consider using the :mod:`ftplib` "
"module."
msgstr ""
"處理 FTP 協定的程式碼無法區分檔案與目錄。當嘗試讀取指向無法存取之檔案的 URL "
"時，這可能會導致非預期的行為。若 URL 以 ``/`` 結尾，則會被假定為指向目錄，並"
"據此處理。但若嘗試讀取檔案時導致 550 錯誤（表示找不到該 URL 或無法存取，通常"
"是因為權限的緣故），則該路徑會被視為目錄，以處理 URL 指定了目錄但省略了結尾 "
"``/`` 的情況。當你嘗試擷取一個因讀取權限而無法存取的檔案時，這可能會導致誤導"
"性的結果；FTP 程式碼會嘗試讀取它、因 550 錯誤而失敗，接著對這個無法讀取的檔案"
"執行目錄列表。若需要更精細的控制，請考慮使用 :mod:`ftplib` 模組。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1621
msgid ":mod:`!urllib.response` --- Response classes used by urllib"
msgstr ":mod:`!urllib.response` --- urllib 所使用的回應類別"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1626
msgid ""
"The :mod:`!urllib.response` module defines functions and classes which "
"define a minimal file-like interface, including ``read()`` and "
"``readline()``. Functions defined by this module are used internally by "
"the :mod:`!urllib.request` module. The typical response object is "
"a :class:`urllib.response.addinfourl` instance:"
msgstr ""
":mod:`!urllib.response` 模組定義了一些函式與類別，它們定義了一個最小的類檔案"
"介面，包括 ``read()`` 與 ``readline()``。此模組所定義的函式會在 :mod:`!"
"urllib.request` 模組內部使用。典型的回應物件是一"
"個 :class:`urllib.response.addinfourl` 實例："

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1635
msgid ""
"URL of the resource retrieved, commonly used to determine if a redirect was "
"followed."
msgstr "所擷取資源的 URL，通常用來判斷是否有跟隨重新導向。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1639
msgid ""
"Returns the headers of the response in the form of "
"an :class:`~email.message.Message` instance."
msgstr "以 :class:`~email.message.Message` 實例的形式回傳此回應的標頭。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1646
msgid "Status code returned by server."
msgstr "伺服器回傳的狀態碼。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1650
msgid "Deprecated in favor of :attr:`~addinfourl.url`."
msgstr "已被 :attr:`~addinfourl.url` 取代而棄用。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1655
msgid "Deprecated in favor of :attr:`~addinfourl.headers`."
msgstr "已被 :attr:`~addinfourl.headers` 取代而棄用。"

#: ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1660 ../../library/urllib.request.rst:1665
msgid "Deprecated in favor of :attr:`~addinfourl.status`."
msgstr "已被 :attr:`~addinfourl.status` 取代而棄用。"

